                "Phthalan-Keld PK-5 o-xylene-air PA-mist UV on air-oxidizer O-2 is 18.4 g/Nm3 PA-mist "
                "against a 12.0 g/Nm3 stop, while quench PT sits 1.6 bar under a 3.0 bar lock. "
                "Air-cut on the o-xylene win is the legal gate; riding the quench lock would leave "
                "the 22.0 kNm3/h cruise untouched. Vanadium-bed AE is silent until a later bed dump.",